// Force post-split genproto so legacy pseudo-versions required by old deps
// (go-grpc-middleware v1.4.0, envoyproxy/go-control-plane v0.9.x, etc.) do
// not re-introduce the googleapis/rpc/status + googleapis/api/httpbody
// packages that now live in the split modules. Mirrored from go.work
// 2026-05-22 so the module is self-sufficient post-extraction to
// github.com/dogukanturhal/platform-shared. Belt-and-suspenders:
// in workspace mode both this and the go.work-level replace apply; the
// go.work one comes out when shared exits the workspace at extraction.
replace google.golang.org/genproto => google.golang.org/genproto v0.0.0-20260414002931-afd174a4e478
